WEBVTT

00:03.500 --> 00:10.000
<v Pat>Take the far chair, baby. Half the lesson comes up those steps before the cards do.</v>

00:10.000 --> 00:18.000
<v Pat>I remember. You'd whisper the count and pretend you weren't hoping somebody would invite you in.</v>

00:18.000 --> 00:19.500
<v Dee>Did it work?</v>

00:19.500 --> 00:22.500
<v Pat>You're in a chair, aren't you?</v>

00:22.500 --> 00:26.000
<v Uncle Ray>Chairs don't make you a player. Staying does.</v>

00:26.000 --> 00:28.500
<v Dee>Ask us after the first hand.</v>
